{"data":{"id":5665,"name":"Helium","symbol":"HNT","slug":"helium","category":"coin","description":"The Economic Engine Powering the Future of Global Connectivity\n\n## Overview\n\nHNT is the currency for connectivity, the economic engine powering the future of global connectivity. Instead of a handful of corporations controlling a $3 trillion telecom industry, HNT flips the model on its head, giving anyone the ability to own a piece of it and participate in building Helium.\n\nHelium is a global, decentralized network redefining how the world connects by enabling individuals to build and own wireless infrastructure. Anyone can deploy devices called Hotspots to provide coverage, earn rewards in HNT, and contribute to a growing network. By putting power into the hands of the people and challenging the traditional telco model, Helium is making connectivity more affordable, accessible, and community-driven than ever before.\n\nNetwork Type: Decentralized Physical Infrastructure (DePIN)\n\nWho Uses HNT: Major telecom carriers, global enterprises, local businesses, and everyday consumers all rely on HNT to power affordable, open connectivity.\n\n## Use Cases:\n\n- Telecom Partnerships: Several of the largest telcos, including AT&T and Telefonica, use Helium to offload mobile data in congested areas (e.g., stadiums, airports, urban centers), reducing infrastructure costs and providing their subscribers with more coverage powered by the people.\n- Enterprise Solutions: Helium Plus is for operators running networks on Unifi, Aruba, Cisco, Meraki, and other device manufacturers. They can upgrade their existing Wi-Fi to expand Helium coverage. Subscribers from major carriers connect automatically, and data usage earns HNT rewards. Helium Plus is ideal for commercial spaces, campuses, and enterprise setups.\n\nBlockchain: Built on Solana, the most battle-tested public blockchain for scalability, low fees, and fast transactions.\n\n## Recent News:\n\nhttps://www.fierce-network.com/wireless/helium-makes-it-easier-use-its-dewi-network\nhttps://blockworks.co/news/helium-crypto-utility\n https://www.fierce-network.com/newswire/att-partners-helium-better-wi-fi-offload\nhttps://www.bgr.com/tech/helium-mobile-launched-the-first-ever-free-phone-plan-with-5g-data-and-voice-for-0/\nhttps://www.telefonica.com/en/communication-room/press-room/telefonica-mexico-bringing-helium-network-2-million-subscribers-mexico/\n\n## Unique Value\n\nThe telco industry is long overdue for disruption. Helium is pioneering a new model where anyone can participate in shaping the future of the industry and be rewarded for their contributions. Together, we're building a network that is bringing affordable connectivity and greater access to information to the masses. Helium is already providing real-world utility to both traditional industry players and consumers, every single day.\n\n## How Does HNT Work?\n\nBuilding the Network: Anyone with a Helium Hotspot can earn HNT by building the Helium Network and connecting nearby devices. The more devices that connect, the more HNT you can earn.\n\nUsing the Network: To use the Helium Network, HNT gets burned. That means every time devices send data, HNT is removed from circulation. The more the Helium Network is used, the more HNT is burned.\n\n## How the Network Works\n\nHotspots: Users deploy Hotspots (plug-and-connect devices) to create network coverage.\nData Transfer: Devices use the network, burning HNT.\nEarnings: Hotspot operators earn HNT based on data relayed.\n\n## Tokenomics\n\nLaunch: HNT was launched with the Helium Network in 2019. There was no pre-mine.\n\nHalving Schedule: HNT follows a predictable 2-year halving schedule, reducing emissions over time.\n\nHard Cap: HNT is currently deflationary, with a hard cap of 223M HNT.\n\n## How to Participate\n\nBuy HNT on centralized and decentralized exchanges\nDeploy a Hotspot and earn HNT for providing coverage\nDevelop applications on Helium's open-source network\n\n## Educational Resources\n\n- Helium World: world.helium.com \n- Helium X: x.com/helium\n- Helium Blog: blog.helium.com \n- Helium Plus: helium.com/plus","dateAdded":"2020-06-05T00:00:00.000Z","actualTimeStart":"2020-06-08T23:20:00.000Z","status":"active","isBn":0,"subStatus":"normal","notice":"","alertLink":"","latestUpdateTime":"2026-10-19T06:42:00.000Z","watchCount":"393639","watchListRanking":122,"dateLaunched":"2019-07-31T00:00:00.000Z","latestAdded":false,"launchPrice":0.273438,"tags":[{"slug":"mineable","name":"Mineable","category":"OTHERS","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"enterprise-solutions","name":"Enterprise Solutions","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"distributed-computing","name":"Distributed Computing","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":2},{"slug":"iot","name":"IoT","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"solana-ecosystem","name":"Solana Ecosystem","category":"PLATFORM","status":1,"priority":1},{"slug":"usv-portfolio","name":"USV Portfolio","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"multicoin-capital-portfolio","name":"Multicoin Capital Portfolio","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"web3","name":"Web3","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"depin","name":"DePIN","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":1},{"slug":"made-in-america","name":"Made in America","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"robotics","name":"Robotics","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3}],"selfReportedTags":["IoT","Mobile","Solana Ecosystem","Coinfund Portfolio","a16z Portfolio","USV Portfolio","Pantera Capital Portfolio","Multicoin Capital Portfolio","ParaFi Capital","DePIN"],"selfReportedCirculatingSupply":"186321438.09","urls":{"website":["https://www.helium.com/"],"technical_doc":["http://docs.helium.com/"],"explorer":["https://solscan.io/token/hntyVP6YFm1Hg25TN9WGLqM12b8TQmcknKrdu1oxWux","https://world.helium.com/"],"source_code":["https://github.com/